<title>SWEDEN: Scania reports '96 quarterly sales/income.</title>
<headline>Scania reports '96 quarterly sales/income.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish bus and truck maker</p>
<p>Scania reports sales and income for 1996 by the quarter with a</p>
<p>second table comparing the results to 1995.</p>
<p> SALES AND INCOME 1996	 Q1     Q2	 Q3	  Q4</p>
<p> No of trucks/buses	  11,691  11,321   8,860    11,119</p>
<p> Sales (Mln SKR)		8,726   8,650   7,190     9,164</p>
<p>Operating profit after</p>
<p>   deprec (Mln skr)	   1,229   1,064     136	 628</p>
<p> Pctge of sales		  14.1    12.3     1.9	 6.9</p>
<p>Profit after fin items</p>
<p>    (Mln skr)		   1,113     989	40	 564</p>
<p> SALES AND INCOME 1995     Q1	  Q2	  Q3	 Q4</p>
<p> No of trucks/buses	 10,840   11,971   9,488    12,338</p>
<p> Sales (Mln SKR)	     8,525    9,490   7,427     9,398</p>
<p>Operating profit after</p>
<p>    deprec (Mln SKR)	 1,521    1,533     834     1,464</p>
<p> Pctage of sales		17.8     16.2    11.2	15.6</p>
<p>Profit after fin items</p>
<p>    (Mln SKR)		  1,401    1,405     706     1,335</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
